{
    "title": "\u0622\u0645\u06cc\u0631\u0632\u0627",
    "description": "Dear friends, welcome to the world of fun and entertainment \"Amirza\".\r\n\r\nAmirza is a different, fun and extremely attractive word game that invites you to a big and sweet challenge. The goal of the game is to find the desired words among the jumbled letters. In the meantime, you have to test your intelligence and intelligence among the elders and mirzas of the word field and increase your credibility, from Mirza Delak Meshtamalian to Mirza Alam Khormand. And all will be tough rivals for you. This game has more than 1000 different stages with dozens of funny Iranian characters, attractive animations, authentic traditional music, spectacular graphics, memorable and native environments, and will entertain you for hundreds of hours.\r\n\r\nGame features:\r\n- More than 1000 interesting and varied stages in the main section\r\n- Daily challenging game\r\n- Hundreds of completely different stages in the game of Master Mirza\r\n- Funny animations\r\n- Traditional and original music\r\n- Extremely eye-catching and native environments\r\n- Spectacular graphics\r\n- More than hundreds of hours of gameplay\r\n- More than thousands of words\r\n\r\n\r\n  \r\nSupport email:\r\ninfo@brainladdergames.com\r\n  \r\n  \r\nAll the intellectual and material rights of this product are reserved for Nardban Andisheh Cultural Institute.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Dear friends, welcome to the world of fun and entertainment &quot;Amirza&quot;.<br><br>Amirza is a different, fun and extremely attractive word game that invites you to a big and sweet challenge. The goal of the game is to find the desired words among the jumbled letters. In the meantime, you have to test your intelligence and intelligence among the elders and mirzas of the word field and increase your credibility, from Mirza Delak Meshtamalian to Mirza Alam Khormand. And all will be tough rivals for you. This game has more than 1000 different stages with dozens of funny Iranian characters, attractive animations, authentic traditional music, spectacular graphics, memorable and native environments, and will entertain you for hundreds of hours.<br><br>Game features:<br>- More than 1000 interesting and varied stages in the main section<br>- Daily challenging game<br>- Hundreds of completely different stages in the game of Master Mirza<br>- Funny animations<br>- Traditional and original music<br>- Extremely eye-catching and native environments<br>- Spectacular graphics<br>- More than hundreds of hours of gameplay<br>- More than thousands of words<br><br><br>  <br>Support email:<br>info@brainladdergames.com<br>  <br>  <br>All the intellectual and material rights of this product are reserved for Nardban Andisheh Cultural Institute.",
